{"c":[{"name":"20261015T175712Z-186d790bde4ed5d2","text":"CadQuery: Workplane.section(z) slices along the normal of the workplane the solid came from (a revolve on XZ slices along y). To get an area at height z, intersect a thin slab.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T175712Z-8a9b068da52fc102","text":"CadQuery: shapes from shapely polylines bloat STEP (4 MB vs 320 KB) and coincident cones make invalid solids; build from true circles and offset touching cones by 0.2.","type":"note"}]}
